"A campus recreation facility with courts, aquatics, fitness space, and more.","evidence_claim":"UAB says currently enrolled students have Recreation Center access included in tuition and identifies the center at 1501 University Boulevard.","source_url":"https://catalog.uab.edu/undergraduate/studentservicesfacilities/","source_title":"Student Services & Facilities | UAB Undergraduate Catalog","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Eligible UAB students should bring a ONE Card; facility access and program availability are subject to university policies.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"uab-climbing-and-bouldering-wall","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Climbing Wall & Bouldering Wall","title":"Try the climbing wall if you have member access","subtitle":"Active option · Campus Recreation Center mezzanine","notes":"Ask Recreation staff about current wall access, required instruction, and equipment before climbing; choose the bouldering wall or a scheduled program that fits your comfort.","short_summary":"A structured, on-campus climbing option within the Recreation Center.","evidence_claim":"UAB documents a 36-foot climbing wall and a 12-foot bouldering wall in the Campus Recreation Center, open to URec members.","source_url":"https://catalog.uab.edu/undergraduate/studentservicesfacilities/","source_title":"Student Services & Facilities | UAB Undergraduate Catalog","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Access is for URec members; ask staff about current wall hours, requirements, and programming.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"mervyn-h-sterne-library","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Mervyn H. Sterne Library","title":"Set aside a quiet stop at Sterne Library","subtitle":"Campus pause · 917 13th St. S.","notes":"Use the library as a calm place to review the weekend, find a study seat, or ask at a service point; check its current weekend hours before arriving.","short_summary":"A named UAB library stop with published visitor-access guidance.","evidence_claim":"UAB’s library access guidelines state that non-UAB visitors may access Sterne Library during library open hours and list Saturday hours of 9 a.m.–5 p.m.","source_url":"https://library.uab.edu/about/policies/access-guidelines","source_title":"UAB Libraries Access Guidelines","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2023-08-01","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Visitor access is limited to library open hours; verify the current calendar and any access requirements before visiting.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"railroad-park","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Railroad Park","title":"Take an evening walk at Railroad Park","subtitle":"Off-campus outdoor stop · Birmingham","notes":"Use the park’s posted entrances and paths for an easy outdoor stretch, then head out before closing; keep any route and transport plan simple and daylight-aware.","short_summary":"A public Birmingham park with long daily hours and no entrance fee.","evidence_claim":"Railroad Park states that it is open daily from 7 a.m. to 11 p.m. and has no entrance fee.","source_url":"https://railroadpark.org/about/faqs/","source_title":"FAQs | Railroad Park","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Officially open 7 a.m.–11 p.m. daily; the park advises using its entrances and provides parking guidance.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"rotary-trail","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Rotary Trail","title":"Continue along Rotary Trail","subtitle":"Downtown connector · four-block walking/running/biking path","notes":"Use the trail for a short, self-paced connection between downtown landmarks; yield to other users and turn back if your group’s daylight or transport plan changes.","short_summary":"A landscaped downtown trail that links Railroad Park toward Sloss Furnaces.","evidence_claim":"The Birmingham Rotary Club describes Rotary Trail as a four-block walking, running, and biking path that connects Railroad Park and Sloss Furnaces.","source_url":"https://www.birminghamrotary.org/rotary-trail","source_title":"Rotary Trail | Birmingham Rotary Club","source_kind":"other_reliable","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor public trail; plan a return route and follow posted conditions.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"sloss-furnaces","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Sloss Furnaces National Historic Landmark","title":"See Birmingham’s industrial history at Sloss Furnaces","subtitle":"Weekend culture stop · 20th Street North area","notes":"Take the self-guided route through the historic site, pause at the interpretive features, and verify the day’s hours before leaving campus for this destination.","short_summary":"A preserved industrial landmark with free general admission and self-guided touring.","evidence_claim":"Sloss Furnaces states that admission is free, self-guided tours are available, and normal weekend hours are Saturday 10 a.m.–4 p.m. and Sunday noon–4 p.m.","source_url":"https://www.slossfurnaces.org/","source_title":"Sloss Furnaces National Historic Landmark","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Official normal hours list Saturday 10 a.m.–4 p.m. and Sunday noon–4 p.m.; guided or special tours may carry a fee.","cost_status":"fre